Provenance
----------
This repository was split out of github.com/openpak/xbox-live (branch openpak,
commit 7fc575dd21485791ed80149deba4f158e66044ae), which is a fork of
https://github.com/XombieOnline/xombie (AGPL-3.0, base commit
7a1ef08045271437efc5938c996cb0c209a31408). Git history for the packages below
is preserved.

Packages that port or take constants/test vectors from Xombie (libs/xblive):
  - xbcrypto  RC4/HMAC primitives for protocol compatibility
  - krb       Kerberos structures, key derivation, public Xombie prototype keys
              (a denylist so deployments refuse them; krb/keys.go)

Packages written for OpenPak, no Xombie code: xbaccountapi, xbenrolapi,
xbfeature, ratelimit.

No Insignia, leaked Microsoft source or other third-party proprietary material
was used. Reference: https://github.com/openpak/docs (xbox/native-service-architecture.md).
